path: "map_bracket_write.at"
```auto
// PLAN-661 T-01: map bracket write (m[k] = v) — write/read symmetry.
// Before the fix, SET_ELEM only downcast ListData, so writing to an
// object/map target aborted with "Invalid array ID" (078 repro).
