## Case: object-alias-and-independent-cell
id: "av.parity.1084.object-alias-and-independent-cell"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1084"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn main() int {
    let original = { inner: { amount: 19, title: "ready" } }
    let other = { inner: { amount: 19, title: "ready" } }
    let same_inner = original.inner
    same_inner.amount = 23
    if original.inner.title != "ready" { return 0 }
    return original.inner.amount + other.inner.amount
}
```

