## Case: nil-truth-and-boxed-coalesce
id: "av.parity.1084.nil-truth-and-boxed-coalesce"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1084"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn main() int {
    let values = { unset: nil, amount: 19, yes: true }
    if values.unset != null || null == values.amount { return 0 }
    if values.unset || !values.yes || !(!nil) { return 0 }
    return (values.unset ?? 23) + values.amount
}
```

