## Case: direct-coalesce-lazy-and-option-none
id: "av.parity.1084.direct-coalesce-lazy-and-option-none"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1084"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn unwanted() int { fail("fallback evaluated") }
fn main() int {
    let values = { amount: 19, unset: null }
    let absent ?int = None
    let some ?int = Some(13)
    let first = values.amount ?? unwanted()
    let second = absent ?? 6
    let third = some ?? unwanted()
    if -1 == null { return 0 }
    return first + second + third + (nil ?? 4)
}
```

